{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00528","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享拜洛乐章 通和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享拜洛乐章 通和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皇皇灵睠，穆穆神心。\n暂动凝质，还归积阴。\n功玄枢纽，理寂高深。\n衔恩佩德，耸志翘襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00528.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00528","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}